is 1632. \n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 34 and 48 is \\boxed{1632}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 34 and 48, we can use the standard multiplication method by breaking down the numbers and then combining the results. Here are the key steps:\n\n1. **Break down 34 into 30 and 4:**\n   - Calculate \\(30 \\times 48\\):\n     - \\(30 \\times 48 = 3 \\times 48 \\times 10 = 144 \\times 10 = 1440\\)\n   - Calculate \\(4 \\times 48\\):\n     - \\(4 \\times 48 = 160 + 32 = 192\\)\n\n2. **Add the results of the two parts:**\n   - \\(1440 + 192 = 1632\\)\n\n3. **Verification using alternative methods:**\n   - Using the distributive property: \\((30 + 4) \\times 48 = 30 \\times 48 + 4 \\times 48 = 1440 + 192 = 1632\\)\n   - Using the multiplication algorithm:\n     - \\(34 \\times 8 = 272\\)\n     - \\(34 \\times 40 = 1360\\)\n     - Adding the shifted result: \\(1360 + 272 = 1632\\)\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 34 and 48 is \\(\\boxed{1632}\\).",
