\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n 10 \\\\\n\\times\\, 34 \\\\\n\\hline\n 340 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nMultiplying the rightmost digit (4) by 10 gives 40, then multiplying the next digit (3) by 10 gives 30. Adding these results (\\(40 + 30 = 70\\)) and noting the carry-over 4, the final product is **340**.\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{340}",
