ddition:**\n   - \\(24\\) can be split into \\(20 + 4\\).\n   - Calculate \\(44 \\times 20 = 880\\) and \\(44 \\times 4 = 176\\).\n   - Add the results: \\(880 + 176 = 1056\\).\n\n4. **Prime factorization:**\n   - \\(44 = 4 \\times 11\\) and \\(24 = 8 \\times 3\\).\n   - Multiply the factors: \\(4 \\times 11 \\times 8 \\times 3\\).\n   - Calculate step-by-step: \\(4 \\times 8 = 32\\), \\(32 \\times 3 = 96\\), \\(96 \\times 11 = 1056\\).\n\n5. **Distributive property:**\n   - \\((40 + 4) \\times (20 + 4) = 40 \\times 20 + 40 \\times 4 + 4 \\times 20 + 4 \\times 4\\).\n   - Calculate each term: \\(800 + 160 + 80 + 16\\).\n   - Sum the results: \\(800 + 160 + 80 + 16 = 1056\\).\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 44 and 24 is \\(\\boxed{1056}\\).",
