0 + 480 \\)  \n   \\( = 1680 \\)\n\n2. **Standard Multiplication**:  \n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     60 \\\\\n   \\times 28 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     480 \\quad \\text{(60 \u00d7 8)} \\\\\n   1200 \\quad \\text{(60 \u00d7 20, shifted one position)} \\\\\n   \\hline\n    1680 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Verification**:  \n   \\( 60 \\times 28 = 6 \\times 10 \\times 28 = 6 \\times 280 = 1680 \\)\n\nAll methods confirm the product is \\(\\boxed{1680}\\).",
