\\times 61 \\) as \\( (80 + 8) \\times (60 + 1) \\)\n- Calculate each term:\n  - \\( 80 \\times 60 = 4800 \\)\n  - \\( 80 \\times 1 = 80 \\)\n  - \\( 8 \\times 60 = 480 \\)\n  - \\( 8 \\times 1 = 8 \\)\n- Add the results:\n  - \\( 4800 + 80 + 480 + 8 = 5368 \\)\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 88 and 61 is \\(\\boxed{5368}\\).",
