sing decimal placement:  \n  77 becomes 770 when the decimal point is moved one place to the right.  \n- Adding 77 ten times:  \n  77 repeated ten times equals 770.\n\nThus, the product of 77 and 10 is \\(\\boxed{770}\\).",
