ent the answer is 300.\n</think>\n\nThe product of 15 and 20 is found by multiplying the two numbers together. Breaking it down:\n\n\\[\n15 \\times 20 = (10 + 5) \\times 20 = 10 \\times 20 + 5 \\times 20 = 200 + 100 = 300\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{300}",
