   \\(1050 + 105 = 1155\\)  \n\n**Verification using the distributive property**:  \n\\(15 \\times 77 = (10 + 5) \\times 77 = 10 \\times 77 + 5 \\times 77 = 770 + 385 = 1155\\).  \n\n**Final Answer**:  \n\\(\\boxed{1155}\\)",
